      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "27",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yothamuni, gaafa gaani isaa diddami shani, hayyu tahe, Yerusalemu keesa ganna kud'ani jaa lafa mohate. Haad'a isaa, maqaani Yerusha, isiini dubra Sadoki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akuma abbaani isaa Uziani tolche, inni waan AABBO Waaqa gammachiisa tolche. Ammo inni aka abba isaa Mana Waaqa seene hit'aana aarse ch'ubbu inseene. Ato akasile tate, biyyiti ch'ubbu illakimne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami balbala Mana Waaqa ta mirga jaare naabo moga Yerusalemu ta Ofeli jed'anile mid'aase jaare Yothamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaareeni Yuda keesati inni dira jaare, badda keesati maneeni jajabduufi doofi jaare, ta nyaapa keesati ufiraa eegani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle inni hayyu Amonitifi duula isaa had'e dabsate, ganna sadi ch'ufa gibira iraa guurate: qarsi kilo kuma saditifi d'ibba afuri, dargaye kilo kuma maro kuma toko; garbule ta kilo kuma maro kuma toko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonti Yothamuni akasi jabaateefi waan inni kara AABBO Waaqa isaa gula baheefi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan Yothamuni tolche ch'ufa, woraana inni loleefi finna inni nama fide, kitaaba Odu Hayyoota Yudafi ta Israeli keesati t'aafaniti t'aafani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafa Yothamuni hayyu tahe, ganni isaa diddami shani, ammalle inni ganna kud'ani jaa Yerusalemu keesa lafa mohate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni due jennaani dira Daudi keesati isa awaalani, ilmi isaa Ahazini fulla isaa hayyu tahe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.27.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hayyu Yuda ka Ahazi jed'ani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
